  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering an Inclusive and Shock-Responsive Social Protection System in Cambodia (FIRST)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Action, Fostering an Inclusive and Shock-Responsive Social Protection System in Cambodia (FIRST), seeks to contribute to a stronger social contract between the Royal Government of Cambodia (RGC) and Cambodian citizens in relation to the ongoing implementation of the National Social Protection Policy Framework (NSPPF)&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
